claim.claim-text:
a first substrate (110);
a bank layer (152) on the first substrate to define first, second and third subpixels (SP_R, SP_G, SP _B);
an anode (132) in each of the first, second and third subpixels;
a first common layer (134) on the anode;
an emitting layer (135) on the first common layer;
a second common layer (136) on the emitting layer;
a cathode (138) on the second common layer, the cathode disposed between a plurality of spacers;
the plurality of spacers (154) being in a periphery of one of the first, second and third subpixels on the bank layer; and
a first encapsulation layer (162),
wherein the cathode is disposed between the plurality of spacers and on a top surface of the plurality of spacers, and
wherein the first encapsulation layer is disposed on the cathode .

a buffer layer (142) on the first substrate;
a thin film transistor (TFT) in each of the first, second and third subpixels;
a bottom shield metal layer under the thin film transistor; and
a passivation layer (146) on the thin film transistor.
